metal2vulkan: MTLFunctionDescriptor.specializedName links a function under another name. Port of IOS-26-Hot phone/metal2/bridge/patches/0102 (MIT, its base 720ef1ce) to 219f013.
RenderBox of 23F84 asks every custom effect by its name (clampToEdges_v1, glow_v1, simplifiedShapeAwareGradientMask_v1) and links it as custom_fn. Without this: Compile(NeedsInput(LinkedFunction { symbol: "custom_fn" })).

